Package: atnet
Title: Antimalarial-Treated Net Effects from Laboratory Assays to Malaria
    Impact
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(c("Andrew", "C"), "Glover", , "a.glover18@imperial.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7235-7231"))
Description: Fits the effects of antimalarial-treated nets on Plasmodium
    falciparum development in Anopheles mosquitoes (transmission blocking
    and lengthening of the extrinsic incubation period) to laboratory
    assay data, and projects their impact on malaria using a customised
    version of malariasimulation.
